graph TD
    %% User Interfaces
    User([Pet Owner]) -->|Natural Language Prompt| StreamlitUI[Streamlit Web App / CLI]
    User -->|Manual Task Entry| StreamlitUI

    %% AI Agent Workflow & Guardrails
    subgraph AI Agent Layer [ai_agent.py]
        StreamlitUI -->|Raw Prompt| Agent[PawPal AI Agent]
        Agent -->|Decompose & Plan| LLM[LLM Planning Engine]
        LLM -->|Raw Task JSON| Guardrails[Validation Guardrails]
        
        subgraph Guardrails & Rules
            Guardrails -->|Check Time Format HH:MM| Check1{Valid Time?}
            Guardrails -->|Validate Priority Level| Check2{Valid Priority?}
            Check1 -->|Invalid| FixTime[Default to 09:00 & Log Warning]
            Check2 -->|Invalid| FixPriority[Default to Medium & Log Warning]
        end
    end

    %% Data Model & Logic
    subgraph System Logic Layer [pawpal_system.py]
        Check1 -->|Valid| TaskObj[Task Objects]
        Check2 -->|Valid| TaskObj
        FixTime --> TaskObj
        FixPriority --> TaskObj

        TaskObj -->|Add Task| PetClass[Pet Model]
        PetClass -->|Registered under| OwnerClass[Owner Model]
        OwnerClass -->|Retrieve Tasks| Scheduler[Scheduler Engine]

        subgraph Scheduler Logic
            Scheduler --> Sort[Chronological Sorting]
            Scheduler --> Filter[Status/Pet Filtering]
            Scheduler --> Conflict[Conflict Detection Engine]
        end
    end

    %% Human Review / Output
    Conflict -->|Flag Hard/Soft Warnings| StreamlitUI
    Sort -->|Render Schedule| StreamlitUI
    StreamlitUI -->|Review & Confirm Schedule| User